{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "All objects",
                  "field": "total",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "object_usage",
                      "params": {
                        "class": "",
                        "ddr": ""
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Used",
                  "field": "used",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "object_usage",
                      "params": {
                        "class": "used"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Rarely used",
                  "field": "rare",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "object_usage",
                      "params": {
                        "class": "rare"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Heavily used",
                  "field": "heavy",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "object_usage",
                      "params": {
                        "class": "heavy"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Entry points (menu)",
                  "field": "entry_point",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "object_usage",
                      "params": {
                        "class": "entry_point"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Unused",
                  "field": "unused",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "object_usage",
                      "params": {
                        "class": "unused"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Without DDR info",
                  "field": "low_confidence",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "object_usage",
                      "params": {
                        "ddr": "without"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "type_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "type_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "type",
                  "label": "Object type",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All object types",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "multiple": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Slider",
                "id": "rare_slider",
                "props": {
                  "param": "rare_max",
                  "label": "Rarely used",
                  "min": 1,
                  "max": 20,
                  "step": 1,
                  "default": 2,
                  "valueSuffix": " using objects",
                  "comparator": "≤"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "no_data_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "No usage data"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "summary",
          "field": "total",
          "equals": 0
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "no_data_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "The catalog holds no objects with a usage count. Either the selection is empty, or the solution was imported before catalog schema 1.40.0 — import it again to build the usage table."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "usage_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Objects by usage",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "usage"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "usage_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": "auto",
              "searchAutoThreshold": 3,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "keepViewOnRowClick": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file, type, name, class or role…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "object_type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "object_name",
                  "label": "Object",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "usage_class",
                  "label": "Class",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "used": "used",
                    "rare": "rarely used",
                    "heavy": "heavily used",
                    "bridge": "bridge",
                    "entry_point": "entry point",
                    "builtin": "built-in",
                    "unused": "unused",
                    "dead_branch": "dead branch",
                    "dead_island": "dead island",
                    "unused_unverified": "unused (unverified)",
                    "dead_branch_unverified": "dead branch (unverified)",
                    "dead_island_unverified": "dead island (unverified)"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "usage",
                  "label": "Usage (internal)",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "refs",
                  "label": "References",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "in_menu",
                  "label": "In menu",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "key_field",
                  "label": "Key field",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "cross_file",
                  "label": "From other files",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "low_confidence",
                  "label": "Without DDR info",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "object_usage",
                  "params": {
                    "obj_uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                    "obj_file": "{{file_name}}",
                    "class": "{{_class_param}}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No object in this selection."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "selected_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Selected object"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "selected"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "selected",
          "field": "nav_uuid",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "selected_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "nav_uuid",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "object_name",
                  "label": "Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "object_type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "usage_class",
                  "label": "Class",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "used": "used",
                    "rare": "rarely used",
                    "heavy": "heavily used",
                    "bridge": "bridge",
                    "entry_point": "entry point",
                    "builtin": "built-in",
                    "unused": "unused",
                    "dead_branch": "dead branch",
                    "dead_island": "dead island",
                    "unused_unverified": "unused (unverified)",
                    "dead_branch_unverified": "dead branch (unverified)",
                    "dead_island_unverified": "dead island (unverified)"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "usage",
                  "label": "Usage (internal)",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "refs",
                  "label": "References",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "roles",
                  "label": "Roles"
                },
                {
                  "field": "in_menu",
                  "label": "In menu",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "key_field",
                  "label": "Key field",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "cross_file",
                  "label": "From other files",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{object_type}}",
                  "file": "{{file_name}}",
                  "tab": "references",
                  "rdir": "in",
                  "rgroup": "owner"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ddr_warning_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Without DDR info — usage unverified"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "selected",
          "field": "low_confidence",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "ddr_warning_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "The file of this object was exported without DDR info. It carries no references from formulas — a use in a calculation stays invisible. An *unused* or *dead* class is therefore marked *unverified*. Export the file again with DDR info before deleting anything."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "to_path_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Relationship path"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "selected"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "selected",
          "field": "is_to",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "to_path_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "Relationship sides are not counted as usage. Whether this table occurrence is needed as a bridge between used ones, or hangs on a dead branch, is decided by the path analysis — click the row to open it in *Table Occurrence Usage*."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "to_path_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "nav_uuid",
              "density": "compact",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "object_name",
                  "label": "Table occurrence"
                },
                {
                  "field": "usage_class",
                  "label": "Class",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "used": "used",
                    "rare": "rarely used",
                    "heavy": "heavily used",
                    "bridge": "bridge",
                    "entry_point": "entry point",
                    "builtin": "built-in",
                    "unused": "unused",
                    "dead_branch": "dead branch",
                    "dead_island": "dead island",
                    "unused_unverified": "unused (unverified)",
                    "dead_branch_unverified": "dead branch (unverified)",
                    "dead_island_unverified": "dead island (unverified)"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "table_occurrence_usage",
                  "params": {
                    "to_uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                    "to_file": "{{file_name}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "details_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Who uses the selected object",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "details"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "selected",
          "field": "nav_uuid",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "details_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": "auto",
              "searchAutoThreshold": 3,
              "pageParam": "details_page",
              "searchParam": "details_q",
              "sortParam": "details_sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search type, object, file or role…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "owner_type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "owner_name",
                  "label": "Using object",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "owner_file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "roles",
                  "label": "Roles",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "refs",
                  "label": "References",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "usage_class",
                  "label": "Class",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "used": "used",
                    "rare": "rarely used",
                    "heavy": "heavily used",
                    "bridge": "bridge",
                    "entry_point": "entry point",
                    "builtin": "built-in",
                    "unused": "unused",
                    "dead_branch": "dead branch",
                    "dead_island": "dead island",
                    "unused_unverified": "unused (unverified)",
                    "dead_branch_unverified": "dead branch (unverified)",
                    "dead_island_unverified": "dead island (unverified)"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{owner_type}}",
                  "file": "{{owner_file}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No usage inside the solution."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "How usage is counted"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Two numbers.** *Usage (internal)* counts the **using objects** — the scripts, layouts, fields, value lists … that use the object; a layout object or layout part counts as its layout. *References* counts every single place (a layout with the field three times = 1 using object, 3 references). The list *Who uses the selected object* has one row per using object, so its row count equals the usage. The search column *Usage (internal)* and the references tab show the same numbers.\n\n**What counts.** An incoming link whose role counts as usage (where-used flag of the link-role registry). Base tables count only their table occurrences, not their own fields. Table occurrences count every `Table::Field` reference, layout and portal contexts and script steps — relationship sides do not count, the path analysis decides (*bridge*, *dead branch*, *dead island*). Relationships have no usage of their own: a relationship is dead when one of its table occurrences is.\n\n**Classes.**\n- *used*: at least one usage. *rarely used* (at most the slider value) and *heavily used* (top 5 % of its type) are views of it.\n- *entry point*: no usage, but the script or layout is in the menu — the user can start it.\n- *built-in*: one of the three built-in privilege sets.\n- *unused*, *dead branch*, *dead island*: the findings of the Analysis Test *Unused Code*; the tile *Unused* adds the dead relationships.\n- *(unverified)*: in a file without DDR info — a usage from a formula may be invisible.\n\n**Limits.** Only usage inside the imported solution counts. Not visible: **calls from outside** — server schedules, Data API, OData, ODBC/JDBC, `fmp://` URLs, AppleScript/ActiveX, plug-ins, files that were not imported; **dynamic references inside** — *Perform Script* by name, `GetField`, `Evaluate`, names inside SQL strings. An unused object is a review candidate, not a delete recommendation. [How usage is counted](/docs/fm-lab/schema/schema%2FUsage%20and%20References)"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
